if {bobchat} == false:
	Bob: hey mannnnn how are you
	Bob: A little cloud today isnt it
	YOU: I guess so
	Bob: Have you come here to seeee your best friend ever... hehe
	YOU: you could say that i guess
	Bob: So what have you come to see me for
	YOU: Do you have the key to closet upstairs
	Bob: Oh yes iv got the key right here
	YOU: Can i have it
	Bob: Why do you need it? You dont work on that floor you work down here
	YOU: Im late and need to talk to the boss
	Bob: Oh late... i was late for a date once the year was early 1946 the war had ended aa few months ago.
	Bob: And while i was on my way home i stoped in this french town for a few days while we waited for the boat
	Bob: adn i met this amazin-
	Bob just shut up i just want the key
	Bob: RUDE TAKE YOUR DAMN KEY
	
	set {item} = "res://inventory/items/keys/keyF2-1.tres"
	
	[signal arg="Give_Item"]
	set {bobchat} = true
elif :
	GO AWAY